# Configuration Flow

At a high level, the documented data and configuration flow is:

Deployment Server
    |-- deploys outputs.conf --> Universal Forwarder
    |-- deploys inputs.conf  --> Universal Forwarder

Universal Forwarder
    |-- monitors linux_security.log
    |-- forwards events on TCP/9997
    v
Indexer Cluster
    |-- indexes data in linux_secure
    v
Search Head Cluster
    |-- searches linux_secure data

Cluster Manager
    |-- manages Indexer Cluster configuration/bundles

Deployer
    |-- manages Search Head Cluster apps/bundles
```

