# Validation Checklist

- [ ] Splunk Enterprise is running on all intended Splunk Enterprise nodes.
- [ ] Splunk Web is disabled on the indexers as configured in the lab.
- [ ] Indexer peers show **Up** on the Cluster Manager.
- [ ] Search Head Cluster reports a healthy status.
- [ ] Search heads are registered with the indexer cluster.
- [ ] Universal Forwarder starts successfully.
- [ ] Universal Forwarder phones home to the Deployment Server.
- [ ] `all_outputs` and `linux_secure` apps are deployed to the intended forwarder.
- [ ] `linux_secure` index configuration is deployed to the indexer cluster.
- [ ] Sample Linux security events are searchable from the Search Head Cluster.

